            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Friends in a Cold Climate: Schiedam-6a"
          },
          {
            "typeName": "subtitle",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "How the ideology of a peaceful and united Europe was married to the emerging youth culture of the sixties and seventies."
